---
title: "team_management (stem-system: Team CRUD Operations)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_admin: checkAdmin()
    q_check_admin --> q_not_admin: not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_route: admin confirmed
    q_not_admin --> [*]: return error (admin required)
    q_route --> q_create: createTeam
    q_route --> q_update: updateTeam
    q_route --> q_delete: deleteTeam

    q_create --> q_validate_create: teamSchema.safeParse(values)
    q_validate_create --> q_invalid_c: invalid
    q_validate_create --> q_insert: valid
    q_invalid_c --> [*]: return error
    q_insert --> q_admin_insert: adminClient.teams.insert(name, discord_role_id)
    q_admin_insert --> [*]: return team or error

    q_update --> q_validate_update: teamSchema.safeParse(values) with id
    q_validate_update --> q_invalid_u: invalid or no id
    q_validate_update --> q_do_update: valid
    q_invalid_u --> [*]: return error
    q_do_update --> q_admin_update: adminClient.teams.update(name, discord_role_id) where id
    q_admin_update --> [*]: return team or error

    q_delete --> q_do_delete: adminClient.teams.delete() where teamId
    q_do_delete --> [*]: return success or error

    note right of q_admin_insert
        INV-001: team CRUD uses adminClient (bypasses RLS)
        INV-002: team name and discord_role_id are required
    end note
